/-!
# SURF-1' box chunk 0

## i. Overview

Expected coefficient vectors of the colour weight W(tree4_u o box1234) at c = 1
for orientation patterns o = 0..15, on the exponent window 36..-9
(46 entries). Generated by sims/surf1/emit_box_chunks.py from a Lean #eval;
the kernel re-derives every vector by `decide +kernel`.

## ii. Key results

- `boxU_o0` .. `boxU_o15`: `ovec boxU o 36 46` equals the listed vector.

## iii. Table of contents

- One theorem per orientation pattern, in order.

## iv. References

- The SURF-1' preregistration and result review in this repository.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace PositiveGeometryEmergentSpaceTime.Surf1

